[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3784.549, "timestamp": "01:03:04", "text": "基本上，它的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3787.589, "timestamp": "01:03:07", "text": "發音和你已經知道的一樣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3812.71, "timestamp": "01:03:32", "text": "你說我又把它拆散了。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3826.39, "timestamp": "01:03:46", "text": "為什麼？  糟糕，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3828.15, "timestamp": "01:03:48", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3831.27, "timestamp": "01:03:51", "text": "做到了。  等等，發生了什麼事？等等，你切斷了訊號？  不，等等。  網路崩潰了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3834.15, "timestamp": "01:03:54", "text": "哦，不。不，你身上已經"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3836.309, "timestamp": "01:03:56", "text": "失去那份特質了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3838.789, "timestamp": "01:03:58", "text": "。"}]